#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:1
msgid "Making a release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:3
msgid "To make a release, follow the following checklist:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:5
msgid "Check with the Product Owner that the `main` branch is code complete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:6
msgid ""
"Check that the distributables built on `main` are working by installing "
"them on your machine."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:7
msgid ""
"Sometimes PyInstaller cannot compile new dependencies, and the "
"application will fail at runtime."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:8
msgid ""
"Create a new PR bumping the version of the application in the "
"`pyproject.toml` file and merge it to main."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:9
msgid ""
"Create a New Github Release with a new tag matching the new version "
"number of the application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:10
msgid "Fill in the Release notes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:11
msgid "Create the Release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:12
msgid ""
"Wait until the GitHub Action for the new tag finishes, and then upload "
"the distributable files to the new Release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/technical-documentation/making-a-release.md:13
msgid ""
"Notify the Communications Team to make the announcement and changes to "
"the [OKFN’s Website](https://okfn.org/opendataeditor/)."
msgstr ""

